1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
When I started working
with machines,

2
00:00:03,425 --> 00:00:05,800
I thought every fault
had a single cause.

3
00:00:05,825 --> 00:00:07,000
(Laughter)

4
00:00:07,025 --> 00:00:09,500
My boss just said: [Nope!]
and walked away.

5
00:00:09,525 --> 00:00:11,000
(Applause)

6
00:00:11,025 --> 00:00:13,400
So I learned to test
before I guess.
